 s are invited to attend. They take place over Zoom on the first Wednesday 
 of every month at 1 p.m. AKT / 2 p.m. PT / 4 p.m. CT / 5 p.m. ET.</p><p>TN
 C staff share updates about work underway with the Collective. We highligh
 t programs\, new resources and decisions that affect members. Founders are
  invited to share updates about their work. This is a space to surface cha
 llenges\, ask questions and celebrate progress. Together\, we discuss what
  members need and explore ways TNC can support them. The goal is to learn 
 from one another and stay connected as a community.</p><br><br><br>Tiny Ne
 ws Collective is inviting you to a scheduled Zoom meeting.<br><br>Topic: T
